# large sparse-code cache (exceeds GitHub 100MB limit)
# needs the **/ prefix: a pattern with a slash is anchored to the repo root,
# so plain "code_cache/sparse_codes.npz" never matched artifacts/<run>/code_cache/
**/code_cache/sparse_codes.npz

# wl_edge AK-SVD dictionaries: 136MB-2.1GB each, over GitHub's 100MB hard limit.
# Smaller aksvd_dictionary.npy files (wl_aksvd, gspan_cork_aksvd) stay tracked,
# so ignore only this run family rather than the filename everywhere.
artifacts/wl_edge_aksvd_*/dict_learner/aksvd_dictionary.npy
